cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository packages a demo viewer and experiment platform built on
  MaleCNS v1.0 data (CC BY 4.0). Project-owned code is MIT-licensed; see
  LICENSE, DATA_LICENSE.md, and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for scope and
  attribution. Please cite both the MaleCNS dataset/paper and this software
  release.
title: "MaleCNS Experiment Platform demo"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Local demo release: a Three.js viewer (port 9205) plus an experiment platform
  (port 9215) showing a synchronized, non-scientific activity stream routed
  through a canonical-universe-validating activity bridge. MaleCNS-derived
  visual assets are redistributed under CC BY 4.0 with attribution. This demo
  does not include or claim MaleCNS dynamics.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MaleCNS Experiment Platform demo contributors"
keywords:
  - MaleCNS
  - Drosophila melanogaster
  - connectome
  - neuroscience
  - visualization
  - demo
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Sexual dimorphism in the complete Drosophila male central nervous system
      connectome
    authors:
      - family-names: Berg
        given-names: "S."
    journal: Cell
    volume: 189
    issue: 18
    start: 5504
    end: 5526.e15
    year: 2026
    doi: 10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015
    notes: "Primary MaleCNS publication; MaleCNS v1.0 data is CC BY 4.0."
